WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.640
The three separated at a fork in the road.

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:08.150
And now their whereabouts are undisclosed. Do they want to protect themselves? Other people?

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.860
Or heavenly dreams?

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:12.820
The creases of disorder are a cauldron of three.

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.450
To an endless, eternal picture of Hell,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:19.530
pushing through time a door is dispelled.

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:24.860
Your grudge shall be released.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.710
Can you help me over here? Is this where it should go?

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:35.120
So that’s the work of Nakiri Kaori-sensei, who we’ve been hearing rumours about.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.570
She’s superior, in the world of flower arrangement.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:40.700
As I expected!

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.530
<i>It’s not right…</i>

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.720
<i>this isn’t exactly the image I’d hoped to present…</i>

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:57.460
Those were the innermost secrets of the Hyakki school.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:39.360
This program is made possible by Sony Music, Aniplex,

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:43.010
and the listed sponsors.

00:02:45.980 --> 00:02:47.920
What are you doing?

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:50.200
It’s a shame to cut them when they’re in bloom!

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:55.960
To make beautiful flowers bloom, we have to separate them like this.

00:02:55.960 --> 00:02:58.800
But somehow I feel sorry for them.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.580
Then, would you like to take some home?

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:01.510
What?

00:03:01.510 --> 00:03:04.370
I’m here helping with that in mind.

00:03:04.760 --> 00:03:06.440
I’m going to throw them away anyway.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.510
If you’d like, why not take some?

00:03:09.420 --> 00:03:10.970
Are you sure?

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:15.720
Oh?

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:17.970
Hyaku?

00:03:17.970 --> 00:03:20.990
The Hyakki family has a scary-sounding name.

00:03:20.990 --> 00:03:23.440
That’s read Nakiri.

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:24.520
Oh?

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:26.280
Nakiri?

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.100
Can I have a moment?

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:30.050
What? Uh… sure…

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:39.540
How is it?

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:41.220
Wow! Amazing!

00:03:41.220 --> 00:03:42.610
Do you like it?

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.560
Yes!

00:03:43.560 --> 00:03:44.990
I’m glad.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:48.040
Then, although it’s bad to ask for compensation…

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.040
A big one!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.170
Can you go buy that for me?

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.070
Sure! Just wait a second!

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:53.830
Baked potato?

00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.830
Thank you!

00:03:54.270 --> 00:03:57.040
In this get-up…

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.110
Are you sure about this?

00:04:00.110 --> 00:04:03.060
Even if it’s during your father’s funeral?

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:06.360
My relatives are so troublesome.

00:04:06.360 --> 00:04:10.570
And it’s always felt like a cold war with my father.

00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:16.680
Yuzuki-chan, have you ever tried arranging flowers?

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:18.070
Only a little.

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:22.690
My school, the Nakiri school, is licensed for flower arrangement.

00:04:22.690 --> 00:04:25.580
Since I’m an only child, I’m the heiress to the school.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.730
Wow, that’s amazing!

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:33.000
But I hated it, so once I graduated high school, I ran away from home.

00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.860
Why?

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:39.870
My mother, who has since passed away,

00:04:39.870 --> 00:04:42.850
used to say to me almost every day that I must inherit it from my father.

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:44.420
But it looks like that was counterproductive.

00:04:48.010 --> 00:04:50.370
You should choose your life by yourself…

00:04:51.240 --> 00:04:54.360
I started thinking that when I was about your age, Yuzuki-chan.

00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:58.190
I haven’t even picked my career yet…

00:04:58.760 --> 00:05:00.240
But that’s normal.

00:05:13.850 --> 00:05:17.340
As always, your whims go too far, Ojou-sama.

00:05:17.340 --> 00:05:20.010
You haven’t changed a bit in all this time.

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.590
You too, Kadokura-san, for saying such things.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:26.610
I’ve been an employee of the Nakiri family for thirty years.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:29.840
Until you, Ojou-sama, become the head of flower arrangement,

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.490
I have no wish whatsoever to retire.

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:36.860
How did you know where I was?

00:05:37.910 --> 00:05:40.360
Because we used to play there a lot together.

00:05:52.460 --> 00:05:54.520
No, it’s not like that.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:59.070
I, like Kadokura-san, am a live-in employee of the Nakiri family.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:02.310
I, in my childhood, was abandoned by my parents.

00:06:02.970 --> 00:06:05.840
The master, with whom I had ties, took pity on me,

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.700
and took me in.

00:06:08.140 --> 00:06:10.250
A childhood friend, or rather,

00:06:10.250 --> 00:06:13.460
Tsukio-san’s like my big brother.

00:06:17.450 --> 00:06:19.670
On second thought, I’ll leave now…

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:23.270
No, no, they say “touching sleeves is the fate of many lives”.

00:06:23.270 --> 00:06:25.270
Please, have some tea.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:28.170
B-But…

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:35.120
Oh! Sensei!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:40.380
Sensei? They’re employees from far away.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:41.620
But…

00:06:41.620 --> 00:06:44.010
There are times when unrelated people look similar by chance.

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:46.280
Y-Yes.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:54.880
Are you saying you were noticed by Yuzuki-san?

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.670
What are you talking about?

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:58.310
Got it, hime?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:02.620
Creating misconceptions in other people is one of our powers.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.040
I see.

00:07:05.260 --> 00:07:07.040
Because we have this power,

00:07:07.040 --> 00:07:10.840
for example if we are in the city collecting data,

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.520
and we accidentally meet Yuzuki-san,

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:18.040
she’ll think we’re different from the people she sees at school.

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:22.540
But, she noticed we were the same people.

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:24.590
Ah, I was shocked.

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:26.660
What does this mean?

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.770
Her awakening…

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:32.880
might be near.

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:36.660
I must tell her soon,

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:38.160
what her fate is.

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:49.410
“You should choose your life by yourself,” eh?

00:07:50.940 --> 00:07:53.570
Kaori-san was so cool!

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.600
If you’re looking for the old man, he’s out.

00:08:12.350 --> 00:08:13.490
They say it’s a cold.

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:14.550
Really?

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.000
It seems to be going around the teachers.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:19.870
Ishimoto-sensei and Sone-sensei aren’t here, either.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:21.860
I see…

00:08:34.710 --> 00:08:36.720
Who is that woman?

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:40.890
That’s Kurotsuka Yukina.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:42.200
That person is?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.720
Yes.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:48.200
She’s the daughter of Kurotsuka Mitsue, who passed away 9 years ago.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:50.220
She came, just as I feared.

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:52.450
Yes.

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:56.200
I have urgently requested the lawyer, Nagasako-sensei.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:06.740
I knew that my father, my father had such a woman.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.250
What do you mean by calling somebody else’s mother “such a woman”?

00:09:12.750 --> 00:09:18.220
My mother believed she would be able to join this house officially one day!

00:09:18.220 --> 00:09:21.790
But, she died without that wish coming true.

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:25.680
What is your wish?

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.950
Is it money?

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.090
Hmph! Don’t mock me!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.770
I just want to make my mother’s wish come true.

00:09:35.710 --> 00:09:38.780
Make me the head of the Nakiri school.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:45.530
I know you left because you didn’t like this house.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.250
Then there’s no reason for hesitation.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:53.910
If I become the head, then my dead mother may be requited.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:58.090
It is not something I can decide on my own.

00:09:58.090 --> 00:10:01.890
And, is there proof you’re really my father’s daughter?

00:10:01.890 --> 00:10:04.960
Oh, if it’s about that, there is no mistake.

00:10:04.960 --> 00:10:07.370
All of the papers are in order.

00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.560
Yukina-san, you certainly have the right to inherit this house.

00:10:15.560 --> 00:10:19.650
However, having said that, it’s not something we can answer immediately.

00:10:20.380 --> 00:10:21.490
What do you think?

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.600
You could stay in this house,

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:28.170
take your time and discuss it.

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:41.060
I can’t, since my heart’s muddled.

00:10:41.430 --> 00:10:44.450
Master just passed away…

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:45.790
And today…

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.380
A lot happened.

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.830
It’s not that.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:52.540
I’ve been in a slump recently…

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:56.450
I’ve hit a wall even in jobs for flower arrangement.

00:10:57.410 --> 00:10:58.720
I see.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:05.400
I guess this is it for today.

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:08.450
Then please go to bed.

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:10.820
I’ll take care of cleaning up.

00:11:10.820 --> 00:11:11.880
Are you sure?

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.040
Yes.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.520
Then, I’ll take you up on it…

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:22.560
Hey, are you still single, Tsukio-san?

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:23.440
What?

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.370
You’re already of good age.

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:27.390
Well, I guess we both are.

00:11:28.710 --> 00:11:31.380
I asked something strange; sorry.

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:34.140
I,

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:38.610
if I can be nearby, serving you, Kaori-san…

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:42.160
I do not need anything else.

00:11:49.320 --> 00:11:50.610
You can’t, Kaori-san!

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:56.100
Tsukio-san, why?

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:57.610
That’s…

00:11:58.490 --> 00:12:02.620
Hey, Yuzuki, what are you going to do, collecting all these photos of our teachers?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:04.670
Well, perhaps…

00:12:04.670 --> 00:12:05.760
Perhaps?

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:06.780
Perhaps.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:14.220
If I show them this, Kaori-san and crew will probably…

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.220
What?

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.060
No way!

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:21.650
Their photos disappeared!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.720
Jigoku… Shoujo…

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.110
You did it, right?

00:12:35.810 --> 00:12:37.580
Why would you do something like this?

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:39.450
Maybe…

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:41.490
The teachers are your…!

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:43.690
Com-pa-nions.

00:12:59.040 --> 00:13:01.470
It’s OK not to force it.

00:13:01.470 --> 00:13:06.150
But Nakasago-san, I heard you were embezzling this house’s assets.

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.460
You’re quite bold, too, aren’t you?

00:13:10.460 --> 00:13:12.510
I accept the praise; thank you very much.

00:13:12.870 --> 00:13:13.980
I’m counting on you.

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.230
Tomorrow I’ll return to Tokyo.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.010
In the meantime, finalize this.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.430
It should take three days before she dies.

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:23.000
So I’ll come back at a suitable time.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.480
If I inherit this houses’s legacy,

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:27.820
I’ll sell this mansion with the land!

00:13:27.820 --> 00:13:30.250
Take care of preparing for inheriting the estate.

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:33.010
Do you have no wish to inherit the license?

00:13:33.010 --> 00:13:34.510
This is no joke!

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:36.960
I said that in front of that woman,

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.400
but who would work with flowers?

00:13:39.400 --> 00:13:41.780
She’s so bad at sitting correctly!

00:13:44.650 --> 00:13:46.190
Is that really it?

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.860
That’s her true motivation.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.070
I understand.

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:54.620
Then, I will tell Ojou-sama about everything.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:56.730
Please do.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.800
Trial?

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:19.990
Yes, as I expected, there’s no choice but to sue that woman.

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:21.010
Here you go.

00:14:23.740 --> 00:14:24.900
Wait.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:37.350
Wait, what are you doing?

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:45.330
Tell that woman to end this now!

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.520
What are you talking about? Sensei!

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:52.970
Sensei!

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:58.780
What do you mean, end this?

00:14:59.840 --> 00:15:02.430
T-Tsukio-san!

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.300
Three more days, at best, apparently.

00:15:08.850 --> 00:15:11.920
Tsukio-san, why?

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:15.110
She thought up something truly dreadful.

00:15:15.110 --> 00:15:18.100
How could she possibly think of killing you, Ojou-sama?

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.100
<i>I won’t forgive her.</i>

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.460
Kaori-san!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:47.140
Jigoku… Shoujo?

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.050
Ichimoku-ren.

00:15:49.560 --> 00:15:51.350
OK, Ojou.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.650
Take this.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:05.340
If you really want to release your hatred,

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:07.660
pull the red string.

00:16:08.110 --> 00:16:13.110
If you pull it, it will signify signing a formal contract with me.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:16.910
The one you hate will swiftly be ferried to Hell.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.560
However, if you release your hatred,

00:16:20.560 --> 00:16:23.630
you must pay the price.

00:16:24.570 --> 00:16:26.920
Curse someone, and two holes are created.

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:32.140
If you sign the contract, your soul will also fall to Hell.

00:16:32.140 --> 00:16:33.500
To Hell…

00:16:34.730 --> 00:16:38.140
Unable to go to heaven,

00:16:38.140 --> 00:16:43.140
your soul will wander endlessly, tasting pain and suffering.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:47.160
Although that’s after you die.

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:53.160
The rest is up to you.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:59.410
Master gave each of the Snow,

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.620
Moon, and Flowers to his children.

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.260
Namely, Kaori-ojou-sama’s “Flower,”

00:17:05.260 --> 00:17:07.280
Kurotsuka Yukina’s “Snow,”

00:17:07.280 --> 00:17:08.440
and…

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:10.520
Tsukio-san’s “Moon.”

00:17:12.300 --> 00:17:15.600
Master, just as he was breathing his last,

00:17:15.600 --> 00:17:19.440
confided that you, Ojou-sama, and Tsukio-sama were siblings.

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:23.740
Tsukio-sama, hearing that, resolved

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:25.720
that no matter what happens to himself,

00:17:25.720 --> 00:17:28.700
he would protect the Nakiri school and you, Ojou-sama.

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:31.780
That didn’t mean he had to do something like that!

00:17:33.620 --> 00:17:37.060
However, Ojou-sama, there’s no reason to grieve.

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:37.710
What?

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.620
“If I wish to stand by Ojou-sama side

00:17:39.620 --> 00:17:42.720
for the rest of my life for whom I feel so much love, it’s going to be impossible through mere willpower.

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:45.290
At least by becoming a container for the flower

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:47.350
I’ll always be near you.”

00:17:47.720 --> 00:17:51.310
That was Tsukio-sama’s resolution.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:54.290
W-What are you talking about?

00:17:57.040 --> 00:18:00.440
In this house, there are actually two separate schools.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:03.310
One is known by the world, the Nakiri school.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.450
And, the other is the head family,

00:18:05.450 --> 00:18:10.700
handed down only through the main branch of the family, the Hyakki school.

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:18.420
The Hyakki school.

00:18:18.420 --> 00:18:24.110
The Hyakki school grows flowers from the skulls of the dead as a mark of respect.

00:18:25.420 --> 00:18:28.020
This is… the “vessel for the flower”…

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:33.430
That is the progenitor of the Nakiri school, Nakiri Rangyaku-sama’s vessel.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.940
People, when they die, become great sacrifices.

00:18:45.940 --> 00:18:50.660
Flowers that grow there reveal life’s nobility to people.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:54.940
Therefore, flowers are beautiful.

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:58.710
Do not be seduced by size or brilliance.

00:19:00.460 --> 00:19:02.830
They give birth to life and death.

00:19:02.830 --> 00:19:03.870
That is…

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:08.810
That is the innermost secret of the Hyakki school.

00:19:10.050 --> 00:19:13.810
What I was searching for, was this.

00:19:21.940 --> 00:19:23.190
Ojou-sama.

00:19:24.420 --> 00:19:28.120
Before we make flowers grow, there is something we must do.

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:33.100
This, as the heiress to this family,

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.330
is my first duty.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.610
Your grudge is received.

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:47.630
I wonder if he did well.

00:19:47.630 --> 00:19:49.470
Eavesdropping is not good.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.520
What is this?!

00:20:18.520 --> 00:20:19.240
Help me!

00:20:19.410 --> 00:20:20.780
Help me!

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:23.500
What?

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:27.280
O pitiful shadow, wandering in darkness.

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:29.360
Scarring people and looking down on them.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:32.500
Drowning in sin is the ball of karma.

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.780
Would you like to die this once?

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:45.410
Why? Why?

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:47.560
Why am I in such a situation?

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:52.560
Spider Lily, also known as the Hell Flower.

00:20:53.310 --> 00:20:57.120
This grudge will ferry you to Hell.

00:21:13.970 --> 00:21:15.260
Kaori-san!

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:22.180
I decided to live as the heiress to the Nakiri school’s main branch.

00:21:23.040 --> 00:21:24.860
What? But before…

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.370
Because this is my fate.

00:21:32.690 --> 00:21:34.130
Fate?

00:21:34.750 --> 00:21:35.970
Kaori-san!

00:21:42.720 --> 00:21:44.730
Kaori-san,

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:46.750
when I die,

00:21:46.750 --> 00:21:48.710
those bones…

00:21:48.710 --> 00:21:50.240
I know.

00:21:56.290 --> 00:21:57.860
Tsukio-san…

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:10.050
Note: Candle says Nakiri Kaori.

00:22:04.690 --> 00:22:10.050
Your grudges shall be released.

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:21.450
You too have an unavoidable fate.

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:22.950
What?

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.870
Mikage Yuzuki.

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:28.930
You will someday become Jigoku Shoujo.

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:30.460
What?

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:34.100
That is… your fate.

00:22:35.420 --> 00:22:37.470
L-Lies.

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:43.260
I… Jigoku Shoujo…

00:24:20.670 --> 00:24:21.810
Your name?

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:23.950
I am called Mizorogi Shougo.

00:24:23.950 --> 00:24:27.080
Why did you write in my name?

00:24:27.080 --> 00:24:32.620
The space prediction constant I discovered told me about a truth.

00:24:32.620 --> 00:24:35.220
A very interesting truth, that is.

00:24:35.920 --> 00:24:37.420
That is not an answer.

00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:40.970
Hey! Old man!

00:24:40.970 --> 00:24:43.470
What’s applied mathematics?

00:24:44.310 --> 00:24:48.150
Next time: Hell Professor versus Jigoku Shoujo.

